==Latin==

===Etymology===
{{unc|la}}. De Vaan suggests from {{inh|la|itc-pro|*wagos}}, from {{inh|la|ine-pro|*Hwogos}}, and compares this form to {{cog|non|vakka||to totter}}, {{cog|goh|wankon||to totter}}, {{m|goh|winkan||to waver, stagger}}, {{cog|ang|wincian||to nod}}.<ref>{{R:itc:EDL|head=vagus|page=651}}</ref> Compare with {{cog|grc|ὄχος}}, {{cog|ang|waġian}}, {{cog|en|wag}}, and {{cog|en|vag}} (the verb).

===Pronunciation===
* {{la-IPA}}

===Adjective===
