# {{lb|la|literal}} [[wandering]], [[rambling]], [[strolling]], [[roving]], [[roaming]], [[unfixed]], [[unsettled]], [[vagrant]]
#: {{syn|la|errābundus|vagābundus}}
#: {{uxi|la|vagus {{l|la|animis}}|t=gone insane, gone mad}}
